        "semanticLevel": "detail",
        "content": {
          "kind": "html",
          "value": "<div style='container-type:inline-size;width:100%;height:100%;min-height:100%'><div style='box-sizing:border-box;width:100%;height:100%;overflow:hidden;font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,Segoe UI,sans-serif;padding:3.4cqw 4cqw;border-radius:5cqw;background:#ffffff;border:1px solid #e2e8f0;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:2.4cqw;overflow:hidden'><div style='display:flex;align-items:center;gap:3cqw'><div style='width:9.5cqw;height:9.5cqw;border-radius:50%;background:conic-gradient(#1d4ed8 0 78%,#e2e8f0 0);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;flex:none'><div style='width:7.2cqw;height:7.2cqw;border-radius:50%;background:#ffffff;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:2.7cqw;font-weight:600;color:#0f172a'>28/36</div></div><div style='flex:1;min-width:0'><div style='font-weight:600;font-size:4.6cqw;line-height:1.2;color:#0f172a;display:-webkit-box;-webkit-line-clamp:2;-webkit-box-orient:vertical;overflow:hidden'>Every selection has one place to edit what an author can set</div><div style='font-size:3.2cqw;color:#64748b'>Michael</div></div><span style='display:inline-block;padding:.3cqw 2.4cqw;border-radius:2.4cqw;background:#eff6ff;color:#1d4ed8;border:1px solid #bfdbfe;font-weight:600;font-size:3.2cqw;line-height:1.4'>In progress</span></div><div data-density='mini' style='display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,minmax(0,1fr));gap:2cqw;flex:1;min-height:0;overflow:hidden'><div style='background:#f8fafc;border-radius:2.6cqw;padding:2cqw;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:0.8cqw;min-width:0;overflow:hidden'><div style='font-size:3cqw;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:.08em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#64748b;margin-bottom:.2cqw'>Next · 8</div><div style='border:1px solid #e2e8f0;border-radius:2cqw;padding:0.6cqw 0.8999999999999999cqw;background:#ffffff;font-size:2.5cqw;line-height:1.25;color:#0f172a;white-space:nowrap;overflow:hidden;text-overflow:ellipsis'>Retire the old tables, keys and per-browser presets</div><div style='border:1px solid #e2e8f0;border-radius:2cqw;padding:0.6cqw 0.8999999999999999cqw;background:#ffffff;font-size:2.5cqw;line-height:1.25;color:#0f172a;white-space:nowrap;overflow:hidden;text-overflow:ellipsis'>Split PropertiesPanel.js by selection</div><div style='border:1px solid #e2e8f0;border-radius:2cqw;padding:0.6cqw 0.8999999999999999cqw;background:#ffffff;font-size:2.5cqw;line-height:1.25;color:#0f172a;white-space:nowrap;overflow:hidden;text-overflow:ellipsis'>Publish the authoritative contract in canon; glossary entries link to it</div><div style='border:1px solid #e2e8f0;border-radius:2cqw;padding:0.6cqw 0.8999999999999999cqw;background:#ffffff;font-size:2.5cqw;line-height:1.25;color:#0f172a;white-space:nowrap;overflow:hidden;text-overflow:ellipsis'>Review the Graph boundary section on the edge panel</div><div style='font-size:3cqw;color:#64748b'>+4 more</div></div><div style='background:#f8fafc;border-radius:2.6cqw;padding:2cqw;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:0.8cqw;min-width:0;overflow:hidden'><div style='font-size:3cqw;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:.08em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#1d4ed8;margin-bottom:.2cqw'>Doing</div></div><div style='background:#f8fafc;border-radius:2.6cqw;padding:2cqw;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:0.8cqw;min-width:0;overflow:hidden'><div style='font-size:3cqw;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:.08em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#15803d;margin-bottom:.2cqw'>Done · 28</div><div style='border:1px solid #e2e8f0;border-radius:2cqw;padding:0.6cqw 0.8999999999999999cqw;background:#ffffff;font-size:2.5cqw;line-height:1.25;color:#64748b;white-space:nowrap;overflow:hidden;text-overflow:ellipsis'>Audit the node Properties panel</div><div style='border:1px solid #e2e8f0;border-radius:2cqw;padding:0.6cqw 0.8999999999999999cqw;background:#ffffff;font-size:2.5cqw;line-height:1.25;color:#64748b;white-space:nowrap;overflow:hidden;text-overflow:ellipsis'>showInBrowse, built</div><div style='border:1px solid #e2e8f0;border-radius:2cqw;padding:0.6cqw 0.8999999999999999cqw;background:#ffffff;font-size:2.5cqw;line-height:1.25;color:#64748b;white-space:nowrap;overflow:hidden;text-overflow:ellipsis'>The root handle on a tile, built</div><div style='border:1px solid #e2e8f0;border-radius:2cqw;padding:0.6cqw 0.8999999999999999cqw;background:#ffffff;font-size:2.5cqw;line-height:1.25;color:#64748b;white-space:nowrap;overflow:hidden;text-overflow:ellipsis'>Apply showInBrowse to the other primitive pages</div><div style='font-size:3cqw;color:#64748b'>+24 more</div></div></div><div style='font-size:3cqw;line-height:1.2;color:#64748b;white-space:nowrap;overflow:hidden;text-overflow:ellipsis'><span style='font-weight:600'>Done when</span>  <span>○ The contract covers node, edge, handle and graph switches, each with where it is written, its default, its valid values and where it applies.</span>   <span>○ Every switch has a control, or a stated reason it does not.</span>   <span>○ Advanced is a last resort, not the way to set a switch.</span>   <span>○ The old type tables, legacy payload keys and per-browser style presets are gone.</span>   <span>○ The Properties panel is no longer one 6,200-line component.</span></div></div></div>"
        },
        "memo": "",
        "link": ""
      }
    },
