        "notes": "2026-10-26 audit: 8 of 20 edge switches have controls (colour, width, dash, route, arrowheads, size, position, name) plus flow/direction/strength/intent. No control: opacity, animation, animationSpeed, glow, gradient, strokes, visible, showLabel. Route writes both route and the older orthogonal flag. Preset style writes several fields at once and is not a switch. The edge class (type) is a select, with no contract entry because it is policy. Node style controls (background, text and border colour, border width, corner radius, font family, size, weight, line height, letter spacing) are in no contract yet: a gap in node scope."
      }
    },
