        "notes": "2026-10-26: built. Edge panel is now Edge (name, type), Ends (collapsed), Line (colour and width, segmented style, route and arrow, More: arrow size, dash pattern, and the contract fields opacity, animation, glow, gradient, strokes, visible, showLabel), Relationship graph, Diagnostics. Meaning (flow, direction, strength, intent) is not on the edge panel: it belongs to the edge class. Cleared style keys now clear (the editor merges style, so a deleted key used to stay). Not yet seen in the editor."
      }
