        "owner": "Michael",
        "status": "done",
        "body": "About 14 controls became about 8 on first sight: an overrides header with reset, three colour swatches (fill, text, border) each clearable, border and radius side by side, one font select (Custom reveals the family), size and weight, with line height, letter spacing and the raw style behind More and Advanced. Clearing a style key now clears (the editor merges style, so a deleted key used to stay). Content nodes honour style.color, size and line height; the preset styles are the separate task.",
