        "body": "Seen once in a local copy: zooming in from the workspace overview left the screen dark with the graph only a tile in the minimap. Not investigated; may be the camera's in-between zoom level, or the earlier blank screen. The Starter (a new graph now begins as a poster environment and a page) is the likely answer for new graphs; close this once canon is published and New graph has been seen to start from it. Seen again 27 October in the preview after navigating between graphs: a blank workspace with an empty minimap.",
